        {
          "id": 3380006561,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "In my WIP tree, I handle control transfers differently. Other transfer types call `dissect_usb_payload()`, while control transfers need to call `dissect_usb_standard_setup_request()` and d`issect_usb_standard_setup_response().` However, I could also short-circuit the control transfer path entirely. I do not have a strong preference either way. What is your opinion?",
